**Tech Stack**

*Hardware & Components:*

Microcontroller: ESP32 (Dual-Core Wi-Fi & Bluetooth MCU)
Actuators: 3× Vibration Motors (ERM/LRA connected to GPIO 25, 26, 27)

*Firmware & Environment:*
Language: C++ / Arduino Framework
Libraries: WiFi.h, WebServer.h

*Networking & Protocols:*
*Wireless standard: Wi-Fi (802.11 b/g/n)
API Layer: Embedded HTTP REST API (/say endpoint) with CORS headers enabled

*Input Interfaces:*

HTTP GET/OPTIONS Requests (over Wi-Fi)
Serial UART Communication (9600 baud backup)

*Tactile Encoding:*
Custom Spatial Motor Combinations
Dynamic International Morse Code Engine
